@startuml
title SD-F04 — Standard proof, expiry and cash
caption To-Be draft | PRD-10–12 / SA-F04 · Settlement
actor Customer as C
actor Merchant as M
boundary API
collections "Private evidence" as Obj
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant Worker
alt DuitNow
 C -> API : Upload proof for owned charge
 API -> Obj : Validate and store immutable bytes
 API -> DB : TX-05 lock parent, check database clock and attach
 Worker -> DB : Same locks for expiry, state and deadline rechecked
 alt Timely registered proof
  M -> API : Verify actual funds and reference
  API -> DB : TX-06 commit receipt and acceptance or exception
  opt Verified underpayment and active allocation
   M -> API : Issue top-up request
   API -> DB : Store 30-minute deadline, notice and expiry work atomically
   alt Valid top-up proof registered before deadline
    C -> API : Upload proof
    API -> DB : Attach proof and retain capacity through review
    M -> API : Verify actual top-up funds
    API -> DB : Post once and accept only at exact eligible total
   else Cutoff reached without timely proof
    Worker -> DB : Recheck current deadline and release unused hold once
    API -> DB : Reconcile partial or late funds separately
   end
  end
 else No registered proof at expiry
  DB -> DB : Expire and release unused hold once
  opt Late evidence or independently verified funds
   API -> DB : Open reconciliation case, preserve terminal state
  end
 end
else Cash pickup
 M -> API : Accept Cash or post collection
 API -> DB : Guard accepted and pickup states, post once
end
opt Customer considers cancellation
 alt No transfer and eligible state
  C -> API : Cancel with no-transfer confirmation
  API -> DB : Recheck version, evidence and eligibility under lock
 else Transfer sent or uncertain
  C -> M : Contact merchant via external WhatsApp
 end
end
M -> API : Reconcile, cancel or refund
API -> DB : TX-06 reserve amount, reconcile payout or void
@enduml
